        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmu9jlnlv3",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 主宅\n最早建成的建筑，曾经短暂地拥有过樱花屋顶形态。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuccoeuj1",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260922-1526-8b96-b36eb2193cce0fa3afb6dcc9307d1648.jpg",
          "alt": "纷湖早期短暂存在过的樱花屋顶主宅",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuccpg6j2",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260922-1527-484d-552ecbb894ec9e6629c9705fdcf9437c.jpg",
          "alt": "纷湖末期的主宅",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuccqbmb3",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260922-1527-032c-5592f4ad41ccda9df82fd1976761dbe8.jpg",
          "alt": "主宅一层的内饰",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuccqsp84",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260922-1528-3f0b-f5fef69e76431e025ebdacd290e1ad47.jpg",
          "alt": "主宅二层的内饰",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmucdwj175",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 公共仓库\n第二栋建筑，日后所有人刚进服后没有居所时共用的仓库。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmucdxtys6",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260922-1619-b239-2b13405af3127f9bfc10948b50dc9fc7.jpg",
          "alt": "山腰上的公共仓库",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmucemdrw7",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260922-1620-090f-9448569793f53a973eed910b91c7d0a5.jpg",
          "alt": "公共仓库的内饰",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuks7a1h1",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 小风车\n用来存放待交易作物的风车。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksd26g2",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1307-6bf9-10ad859052d441ad20473867f859df23.jpg",
          "alt": "刚刚建成的小风车",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksdlxx3",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1307-ae4b-6bd15cdee4e9aab616903d2f88a4ff8d.jpg",
          "alt": "小风车内的仓库",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksg12t4",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 嗅探兽农场\n用来饲养历经千辛万苦刷到的嗅探兽蛋的农场，同时兼顾蜜蜂农场。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukshkkt5",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1311-78e7-ab306c1e6836e76ffa96fce2abc00a46.jpg",
          "alt": "嗅探兽农场",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksi2il6",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1311-dae9-ec7ef53d7ebce32b40d2fb2044d8aeff.jpg",
          "alt": "农场里的蜂箱和熊猫",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksivov7",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1312-240e-bbc8a583de8b747a27c0e9bb718d0178.jpg",
          "alt": "围观嗅探兽宝宝诞生的众人",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksjolp8",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1312-c017-97fa3333fdcdde55af0558641f6757c5.jpg",
          "alt": "小小嗅探兽！",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksk3pp9",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 龙蛋祭坛\n龙蛋的居所。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukskotz10",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1313-36b1-7ad4cea0840e9f710bb69aff4b657738.jpg",
          "alt": "龙蛋祭坛",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukskzql11",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1313-602a-cd0c45e30cb57b86b75846830ae42eba.jpg",
          "alt": "危险！勿触！",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksmd8d13",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 美西螈池\n为了饲养美西螈挖掘的美丽小池塘，然而其中经常发生美西螈失踪事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukso2p914",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1316-d932-adac40a97f45dfc6a25930123154b348.jpg",
          "alt": "池塘中的美西螈",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksoen915",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1316-0abc-870ac9433f579114fd0517c7195e1cc9.jpg",
          "alt": "跳入池塘的虹星",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksp48f16",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1316-e7ba-daa5c5a3f64bac6b13f986cb217ebd18.jpg",
          "alt": "在没有AE与机械动力的时代古法填水的池塘",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksqcrx17",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 马厩\n出于隰辰煦对骷髅马的喜爱而打造的马厩。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksr46m18",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1318-4c2a-938c0fee4485f246eda45a88e6102fd9.jpg",
          "alt": "饲养着骷髅马的马厩",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksro1l19",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### TNT复制机纪念馆\n临时的生电作品，实际上除了炸出一个大深坑外并没有对隰辰煦的建设起到什么帮助。因为深板岩实在是太难挖了！"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukst9ml20",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1320-87d9-0c5a4df44dc8f7064ffd78b4785be97c.jpg",
          "alt": "刚刚部署的TNT复制机",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukstw6t21",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 猫爬架\n可爱的猫爬架，也是第一个主要使用樱花制作的建筑，标志着隰辰煦的建筑风格开始向着樱深风急速倾斜。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksvn2522",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1321-e6c4-6de580b589142a4d9439885b4977dc08.jpg",
          "alt": "樱花与深板岩组成的猫爬架",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksw3p924",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 信标塔\n贯穿了纷湖，花娅地，新花娅地的经典款信标塔。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukswvw925",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1322-80b9-febd2970df5588020b72e9523c642e7e.jpg",
          "alt": "山顶的信标塔",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksxbol26",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1323-27d3-a608e8c679ee753c8016974f7a7b3762.jpg",
          "alt": "在没有喷气背包的时代纯脚手架高空作业搭建的信标塔",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuksy0xi27",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 海龟农场\n原本是吉吉为了做成就而临时搭建的龟棚，因为地处隰辰煦家山脚且过于突兀被隰辰煦爆改。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukszbo628",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1325-649e-7c3ce5d8a3425a8e47e670c074a0e346.jpg",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt04vr29",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1325-7382-3334def9eb168976d1c284a2e7ee8be1.jpg",
          "alt": "改造后的海龟农场",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt0pa630",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1325-7497-4a0f2141678d000d5db85e8641ce39f5.jpg",
          "alt": "海龟农场的前身",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt305a31",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1328-a31e-f9f2df1dd11f4959e80dc3d366f9ca3d.jpg",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt3t7z33",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 轻心小屋\n饲养了悦灵的小屋，不知为何在结档前悦灵全都神秘失踪了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt4utq34",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1329-6798-e97209d051f7b40cc7c4c6ce85f9a492.jpg",
          "alt": "轻心小屋与门前的小餐亭",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt6bjt35",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1330-ea53-bbde12330927b23d752ec9972f0a6041.jpg",
          "alt": "正在与悦灵互动的桑芙",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt6by636",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1330-4959-5cf3dae330b8dfc6470f6da04b065630.jpg",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt777z37",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 地铁站\n连接着冰道船系统的地铁站，门口的大宝剑地狱门因为串门已经失去了交通功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt8kpz38",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1332-f612-9e455b4ff6559711fe672313f454acdc.jpg",
          "alt": "地铁口入口",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmukt8w0e39",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1333-edcc-c3e959b0a514bbe086612d3174d0179a.jpg",
          "alt": "地铁站的二层站台",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuktaveq40",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1333-1ed0-463d0621bc523da29b6f3d06276c847a.jpg",
          "width": "third"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuktb2e841",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1333-6dca-e51f616920438c072bfdd0cbde24df5d.jpg",
          "alt": "地铁站的月台鱼缸",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuktbqdi42",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1334-4286-515b0312464e6d49e019d848a396e194.jpg",
          "alt": "熙熙攘攘的地铁站",
          "width": "half"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuktcmye43",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### 结档大圆环\n隰辰煦为纪念结档而做的原版生存收官大作，在没有蓝图炮与喷气背包的时代耗时七集才终于施工完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuktel0q44",
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/img/uploads/20260928-1336-1568-70d9b7d59f6292a6e40fb36916c676a3.jpg",
          "alt": "大圆环完工之日",
          "width": "wide"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuayn1lp17",
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmu9hjdjz5",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## 溪流之外的轶事\n- 起初隰辰煦真的有过使用樱花木做屋顶的想法，但是因为樱花木颜色过于鲜艳，在与虹星一起综合考量过后还是放弃了，使用白桦木制作了屋顶。然而之后的事情大家也都清楚，隰辰煦已经彻底樱堕落。\n- 隰辰煦家地铁站的站台鱼缸里不止有鱼，还有一匹骷髅马。\n- 十五问曾经计划用来作为悦灵小屋内的员工，可后来神秘失踪。之后的纷湖后期，小屋内的悦灵也神秘消失，至此悦灵小屋实质上已经沦为了鬼宅。\n- 因为纷湖的居住范围过小，地铁口前的大宝剑地狱门曾发生过极其严重的串门。隰辰煦与虹星，吉吉等人与串门进行了一番缠斗最后也没有修好。\n- 隰辰煦家地铁站的进站平台处有一个用玻璃封住的神秘通道。实际上那是最早的地铁隧道的痕迹残留。因为隰辰煦家地势高而虹星家地势低，这条隧道实际上挖到虹星家时已经顶到虹星家地板，因此被废弃。\n"
        },
        {
          "id": "page-mu9fd13e-pmuayn49o18",
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
